  m_Name: Sugarcane
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WILCommunityGame.InformationTipSO
  text: 'Sugarcane is an important agricultural crop in South Africa. It is grown
    mainly for sugar production and requires plenty of water. While it is not a balanced
    food source, selling sugarcane can provide income that farmers can use to support
    their farms and communities. '
